{"id":"forecast-03","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-03/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":330.94,"segments":[{"start":2.1,"end":9.86,"text":"Part 1. You will hear a conversation between an Australian accommodation agent and an English","words":[["Part",2.1,2.5],["1.",2.5,3.06],["You",4.26,4.5],["will",4.5,4.68],["hear",4.68,4.92],["a",4.92,5.12],["conversation",5.12,5.8],["between",5.8,6.3],["an",6.3,6.54],["Australian",6.54,7.24],["accommodation",7.24,7.88],["agent",7.88,8.58],["and",8.58,9.44],["an",9.44,9.6],["English",9.6,9.86]]},{"start":9.86,"end":16.96,"text":"woman who wants to rent a property in Sydney. First you have some time to look at questions","words":[["woman",9.86,10.28],["who",10.28,10.58],["wants",10.58,10.92],["to",10.92,11.16],["rent",11.16,11.36],["a",11.36,11.5],["property",11.5,11.94],["in",11.94,12.38],["Sydney.",12.38,12.74],["First",14.2,14.9],["you",14.9,15.12],["have",15.12,15.3],["some",15.3,15.5],["time",15.5,15.94],["to",15.94,16.24],["look",16.24,16.38],["at",16.38,16.54],["questions",16.54,16.96]]},{"start":16.96,"end":42.2,"text":"one to four. Now listen carefully and answer questions one to four.","words":[["one",16.96,17.48],["to",17.48,17.72],["four.",17.72,18.22],["Now",38.52,38.86],["listen",38.86,39.24],["carefully",39.24,39.7],["and",39.7,40.08],["answer",40.08,40.52],["questions",40.52,41.02],["one",41.02,41.5],["to",41.5,41.72],["four.",41.72,42.2]]},{"start":45.64,"end":48.4,"text":"Hi Jessica, nice to meet you. Have a seat.","words":[["Hi",45.64,46.04],["Jessica,",46.04,46.48],["nice",46.78,46.98],["to",46.98,47.26],["meet",47.26,47.44],["you.",47.44,47.74],["Have",47.84,47.94],["a",47.94,48.18],["seat.",48.18,48.4]]},{"start":48.7,"end":49.38,"text":"Thanks.","words":[["Thanks.",48.7,49.38]]},{"start":49.96,"end":52.84,"text":"So, you're looking to rent an apartment in Sydney.","words":[["So,",49.96,50.42],["you're",50.66,50.88],["looking",50.88,51.06],["to",51.06,51.3],["rent",51.3,51.5],["an",51.5,51.68],["apartment",51.68,52.04],["in",52.04,52.44],["Sydney.",52.44,52.84]]},{"start":52.84,"end":57.74,"text":"That's right. Like I said on the phone, I'm going to be working in a bank here for the","words":[["That's",52.84,53.66],["right.",53.66,53.88],["Like",54.24,54.46],["I",54.46,54.7],["said",54.7,54.88],["on",54.88,55.04],["the",55.04,55.14],["phone,",55.14,55.46],["I'm",55.7,55.98],["going",55.98,56.16],["to",56.16,56.28],["be",56.28,56.38],["working",56.38,56.64],["in",56.64,56.82],["a",56.82,56.92],["bank",56.92,57.14],["here",57.14,57.44],["for",57.44,57.64],["the",57.64,57.74]]},{"start":57.74,"end":58.26,"text":"next year.","words":[["next",57.74,57.92],["year.",57.92,58.26]]},{"start":58.68,"end":63.94,"text":"Well, I've had a look around for you and there's one apartment I think might just suit you.","words":[["Well,",58.68,58.94],["I've",59.12,59.44],["had",59.44,59.58],["a",59.58,59.68],["look",59.68,59.8],["around",59.8,60.1],["for",60.1,60.4],["you",60.4,60.68],["and",60.68,61.08],["there's",61.08,61.36],["one",61.36,61.62],["apartment",61.62,62.08],["I",62.08,62.38],["think",62.38,62.62],["might",62.62,62.94],["just",62.94,63.28],["suit",63.28,63.66],["you.",63.66,63.94]]},{"start":64.44,"end":67.24,"text":"It's in central Sydney, not out in a suburb.","words":[["It's",64.44,64.74],["in",64.74,64.84],["central",64.84,65.34],["Sydney,",65.34,65.86],["not",66.02,66.28],["out",66.28,66.5],["in",66.5,66.66],["a",66.66,66.8],["suburb.",66.8,67.24]]},{"start":67.48,"end":70.38,"text":"Okay, so what sort of apartment is it?","words":[["Okay,",67.48,67.8],["so",68.26,68.82],["what",68.82,69.18],["sort",69.18,69.42],["of",69.42,69.56],["apartment",69.56,69.88],["is",69.88,70.18],["it?",70.18,70.38]]},{"start":70.74,"end":76.9,"text":"Well, it's a studio, so basically it's designed for a single person or a couple. You're","words":[["Well,",70.74,71.04],["it's",71.28,71.52],["a",71.52,71.62],["studio,",71.62,72.12],["so",72.5,72.78],["basically",72.78,73.3],