"end":125.44,"text":"One thing I'd really like is a garden so I can sit outside. Does the apartment block","words":[["One",119.96,120.22],["thing",120.22,120.46],["I'd",120.46,120.78],["really",120.78,121.22],["like",121.22,121.6],["is",121.6,121.9],["a",121.9,122.04],["garden",122.04,122.36],["so",122.36,122.64],["I",122.64,122.78],["can",122.78,122.94],["sit",122.94,123.1],["outside.",123.1,123.62],["Does",124.36,124.58],["the",124.58,124.88],["apartment",124.88,125.2],["block",125.2,125.44]]},{"start":125.44,"end":125.98,"text":"have one?","words":[["have",125.44,125.74],["one?",125.74,125.98]]},{"start":126.32,"end":130.86,"text":"No, but your apartment has a balcony, so there's room to sit out there.","words":[["No,",126.32,126.74],["but",127.14,127.4],["your",127.4,127.56],["apartment",127.56,127.96],["has",127.96,128.2],["a",128.2,128.34],["balcony,",128.34,128.72],["so",129.1,129.34],["there's",129.34,129.64],["room",129.64,129.9],["to",129.9,130.08],["sit",130.08,130.3],["out",130.3,130.5],["there.",130.5,130.86]]},{"start":134.14,"end":139.22,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["Before",134.14,134.64],["you",134.64,134.9],["hear",134.9,135.2],["the",135.2,135.4],["rest",135.4,135.66],["of",135.66,135.8],["the",135.8,135.9],["conversation,",135.9,136.56],["you",137.12,137.36],["have",137.36,137.56],["some",137.56,137.74],["time",137.74,138.2],["to",138.2,138.44],["look",138.44,138.62],["at",138.62,138.78],["questions",138.78,139.22]]},{"start":139.22,"end":174.37,"text":"questions 5-10. Now listen and answer questions 5-10.","words":[["questions",139.22,139.42],["5",139.42,139.76],["-10.",139.76,140.4],["Now",170.61,171.15],["listen",171.15,171.49],["and",171.49,171.99],["answer",171.99,172.47],["questions",172.47,173.11],["5",173.11,173.67],["-10.",173.67,174.37]]},{"start":177.75,"end":183.33,"text":"Okay, well it all sounds good. Now, does the apartment block have any special facilities","words":[["Okay,",177.75,178.23],["well",178.53,178.81],["it",178.81,179.11],["all",179.11,179.35],["sounds",179.35,179.57],["good.",179.57,179.87],["Now,",180.45,180.69],["does",180.79,180.99],["the",180.99,181.15],["apartment",181.15,181.43],["block",181.43,181.77],["have",181.77,182.05],["any",182.05,182.29],["special",182.29,182.79],["facilities",182.79,183.33]]},{"start":183.33,"end":185.15,"text":"for tenants like a gym?","words":[["for",183.33,183.71],["tenants",183.71,183.93],["like",183.93,184.57],["a",184.57,185.03],["gym?",185.03,185.15]]},{"start":185.47,"end":191.21,"text":"Yeah, it does. That's on the first floor and all residents have access to that free","words":[["Yeah,",185.47,185.77],["it",185.85,185.99],["does.",185.99,186.17],["That's",186.65,186.95],["on",186.95,187.07],["the",187.07,187.21],["first",187.21,187.57],["floor",187.57,188.11],["and",188.11,188.71],["all",188.71,189.03],["residents",189.03,189.31],["have",189.31,189.79],["access",189.79,190.23],["to",190.23,190.51],["that",190.51,190.83],["free",190.83,191.21]]},{"start":191.21,"end":195.13,"text":"of charge. And if you like swimming, you've got an indoor pool.","words":[["of",191.21,191.35],["charge.",191.35,191.75],["And",192.27,192.73],["if",192.73,192.87],["you",192.87,192.95],["like",192.95,193.17],["swimming,",193.17,193.57],["you've",194.05,194.31],["got",194.31,194.41],["an",194.41,194.57],["indoor",194.57,194.81],["pool.",194.81,195.13]]},{"start":195.43,"end":195.77,"text":"Great.","words":[["Great.",195.43,195.77]]},{"start":195.77,"end":201.07,"text":"And one special feature of the building is it even has a couple of cinemas.","words":[["And",195.77,196.57],["one",196.57,196.87],["special",196.87,197.31],["feature",197.31,197.67],["of",197.67,197.85],["the",197.85,197.93],["building",197.93,198.21],["is",198.21,198.89],["it",198.89,199.19],["even",199.19,199.59],["has",199.59,199.91],["a",199.91,200.07],["couple",200.07,200.29],["of",200.29,200.47],["cinemas.",200.47,201.07]]},{"start":201.45,"end":205.77,"text":"They're on the ground floor, so you can even take in a movie without leaving the","words":[["They're",201.45,201.93],["on",201.93,202.03],["the",202.03,202.11],["ground",202.11,202.39],["floor,",202.39,202.77],["so",203.17,203.45],["you",203.45,203.61],["can",203.61,203.69],["even",203.69,203.91],["take",203.91,204.23],["in",204.23,204.39],["a",204.39,204.47],["movie",204.47,204.83],["without",204.83,205.19],["leaving",205.19,205.59],["the",205.59,205.77]]},{"start":205.77,"end":210.63,"text":"building. Of course they're open to the public, but I think residents get a","words":[["building.",205.77,206.13],["Of",206.89,207.25],["course",207.25,207.63],["they're",207.63,208.05],["open",208.05,208.27],["to",208.27,208.43],["the",208.43,208.55],["public,",208.55,208.89],["but",209.19,209.45],["I",209.45,209.59],["think",209.59,209.83],["residents",209.83,210.21],["get",210.21,210.51],["a",210.51,210.63]]},{"start":210.63,"end":217.13,"text":"reduction. Right. And what happens about parking? Is that underground? That's","words":[["reduction.",210.63,211.07],["Right.",211.53,211.95],["And",212.65,213.13],["what",213.13,213.35],["happens",213.35,213.77],["about",213.77,214.15],["parking?",214.15,214.81],["Is",215.55,215.79],["that",215.79,215.99],["underground?",215.99,216.37],["That's",216.83,217.13]]},{"start":217.13,"end":225.75,"text":"right. Do you have a car? Not yet, but I'll probably need one I suppose. I'm","words":[["right.",217.13,217.45],["Do",217.91,218.13],["you",218.13,218.25],["have",218.25,218.41],["a",218.41,218.53],["car?",218.53,218.69],["Not",219.05,219.43],["yet,",219.43,219.91],["but",219.91,220.27],["I'll",220.27,220.53],["probably",220.53,220.89],["need",220.89,221.23],["one",221.23,221.45],["I",221.45,221.59],["suppose.",221.59,221.93],["I'm",225.11,225.75]]},{"start":225.75,"end":230.91,"text":"Well, one big plus of this location is the fact that it's in an excellent situation as","words":[["Well,",22